help_exec() {
    cat <<EOF
$PROG exec [options] [--] COMMAND [ARGUMENT ...]

Run a command in every repository, several at a time, and print what it
wrote under the name of each repository, in the order of the folders. The
command starts at "--", or at the first word that is not an option, and
