      --dirty        only the repositories with pending changes
      --clean        only those without
      --ahead        only those with commits to push
      --behind       only those behind the last fetch
      --timeout SEC  stop a command that runs longer (default: no limit)
  and the common options, see: $PROG help

The exit status is 1 when the command failed somewhere.
