help_doctor() {
    cat <<EOF
$PROG doctor [options] [folder ...]

Health check. Nothing is changed. For each repository:

  problems   an operation left in progress, unresolved conflicts, a branch
             whose upstream is gone, a password or a token written in the
             address of a remote, a repository that GitHub does not know,
             a folder that git refuses to read
  warnings   no remote (the repository exists on this machine only), a
